---
title: "cancel (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_check_not_locked: cancelLocked == false
    q_check_not_locked --> q_check_not_canceled: canceled == false
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_cancel: canceled = true
    q_cancel --> [*]: emit AuctionCanceled event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized caller
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_not_locked --> q_revert_locked: cancelLocked == true
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert CancellationLocked
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_revert_dup: already canceled
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyCanceled

    note right of q_cancel
        INV-001: cancel only possible before initializePublishSaleResults
        INV-002: cancelLocked == false is prerequisite (never set back to false)
        INV-003: only projectAdmin can cancel
        INV-004: canceled transitions from false to true exactly once
    end note
